<title>PORTUGAL: No 6-mth bills placed at auction in Portugal.</title>
<headline>No 6-mth bills placed at auction in Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Public Credit Management Institute (IGCP) placed no six-month bills at today's auction, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The bills were previously placed at an average weighted interest rate of 5.7718 percent on February 24.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
